{"id": "bauer-port-rent-and-sprinkler-settlement", "title": "A Port tenant accumulated more than $6.9 million in debt across three sites", "seconds": 59.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "a471df81f93b7f6a", "words": 149, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "When the Pier 50 lease expired, Bauer stayed and continued paying the old rate.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.56, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "happened", "to", "the", "Port", "rent?"], "sub": "Bauer settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.29, 0.72, 1.14, 1.45, 2.55, 3.03, 3.55, 3.68, 4.2, 4.62, 4.75, 4.98]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Port staff said the higher holdover rate left a gap exceeding 60,000 dollars a month.", "t0": 5.68, "t1": 11.39, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "history", "kicker": "Port of San Francisco", "text": "Holdover rent", "mark": "Holdover rent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.73, 0.97, 1.12, 1.54, 2.08, 2.44, 2.71, 2.79, 3.11, 3.74, 4.32, 4.82, 5.26, 5.35]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Board cited debt exceeding 6.9 million dollars across three agreements.", "t0": 11.51, "t1": 16.68, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Three Port agreements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.45, 0.86, 1.1, 1.65, 1.97, 2.33, 2.65, 2.99, 3.75, 4.24, 4.54]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "All 11 supervisors voted for the settlement in July 2026.", "t0": 16.9, "t1": 21.34, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "July 28, 2026", "mark": "July 28, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.85, 1.61, 1.94, 2.08, 2.19, 2.69, 2.86, 3.31, 3.63]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Port staff calculated a reduction of 1,651,392 dollars in past rent.", "t0": 21.46, "t1": 26.82, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,651,392", "label": "Retroactive reduction in Pier 50 rent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.8, 1.4, 1.49, 1.93, 2.03, 2.35, 2.71, 3.08, 3.39, 3.71, 4.44, 4.65, 5.05]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The agreement called for an upfront payment and a 60-month plan.", "t0": 26.94, "t1": 31.61, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Board settlement", "heading": "Terms for payment", "source": "board", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Upfront amount", "value": "$859,309"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Payment plan", "value": "$2,430,477.56"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.67, 1.13, 1.29, 1.45, 2.02, 2.76, 3.08, 3.23, 4.16]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "Future credits depend on verified sprinkler costs and are capped at two million dollars.", "t0": 31.73, "t1": 36.95, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "port", "kicker": "Port of San Francisco", "text": "Future rent credits", "mark": "Future rent credits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.98, 1.39, 1.54, 2.11, 2.62, 3.11, 3.28, 3.44, 3.85, 3.97, 4.27, 4.65]}, {"scene": "relief", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Federal records identify two pandemic loans to the Pier 50 company.", "t0": 37.17, "t1": 41.58, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ppp", "kicker": "U.S. Small Business Administration", "text": "Pier 50 loans", "mark": "Pier 50 loans"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.93, 1.52, 1.96, 2.57, 2.96, 3.08, 3.21, 3.56, 3.92]}, {"scene": "relief", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The same corporation also received transportation grant payments.", "t0": 41.7, "t1": 46.33, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Federal relief", "heading": "Awards to the same company", "source": "certs", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "2020 loan", "value": "$3,463,500"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "2021 loan", "value": "$2 million"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Transportation grants", "value": "$2,914,094"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.63, 1.73, 2.23, 2.85, 3.81, 4.08]}, {"scene": "relief", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Together the loans and grants totaled 8,377,594 dollars.", "t0": 46.45, "t1": 51.02, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8,377,594", "label": "Federal loan principal and grant payments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.63, 1.01, 1.16, 1.55, 2.01, 2.41, 2.75, 3.11, 3.5, 3.96]}, {"scene": "relief", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The available records leave open how the funds were used and what the Port collected.", "t0": 51.14, "t1": 55.9, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Federal funds used", "Rent collected", "Credits applied"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.7, 1.15, 1.41, 1.69, 1.84, 1.99, 2.37, 2.59, 3.17, 3.54, 3.74, 3.87, 4.17]}, {"scene": "relief", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 56.02, "t1": 58.65, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Pier 50", "terms": "What the Board approved", "relief": "A separate source of public money"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "question"}